  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "You can combine this product with a Multi-Function Core Board to form a Cyberbrick receiver module. By pairing the Remote Control Transmitter Shield with another Multi-Function Core Board, you can create a Cyberbrick transmitter module. Connect joysticks and buttons to the transmitter module, and connect motors or servos to the receiver module, and you will have the minimal Cyberbrick remote control car project unit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Servo Ports Pin Definition"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Please strictly follow the wire sequence below to avoid damaging the components.​"
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Introduction</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">You can combine this product with a <strong>Multi-Function Core Board</strong> to form a Cyberbrick receiver module. By pairing the <strong>Remote Control Transmitter Shield</strong> with another <strong>Multi-Function Core Board</strong>, you can create a Cyberbrick transmitter module. Connect joysticks and buttons to the transmitter module, and connect motors or servos to the receiver module, and you will have the minimal Cyberbrick remote control car project unit.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Can be combined with the Official R/C Combo Kits</h2>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 20px; text-align: left;\"><strong>Remote Control Toys</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pctpct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/a69f0291443d40d1bbd194b8721f3cf8/RC.png\" height=\"1050\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"3000\"/></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--Specification-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Servo Ports Pin Definition</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Please strictly follow the wire sequence below to avoid damaging the components.​</strong></p>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\"><!--Banner-->\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: -20px; width: 100%;\"><!---图片链接替换----><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.eu/s8/default/02a07c9c18584706993e86f0e07fbc6f/Frame_1123867067-1.png\" height=\"1404\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"4500\"/></p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\"><!--Banner-->\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%;\"><!---图片链接替换----><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/b7f0c4f1fc4d4b939e1f8661db40fbeb/XA004.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></p>\n<!--Specification--> <!-- 参数表格 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\">\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Item Number</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Component</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Description</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\"><!--红字文本替换 添加列数需要复制整个tr模块-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">1</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">WS2812 Port</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Connectable with WS2812 LED hub or WS2812 LED strip</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">2</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">DC Motor Port</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Connectable with DC motor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">3</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Servo Port</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Connectable with universal 5V servo motors</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">4</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Power Input</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">XH2.54 2Pin DC power input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">5</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Power Indicator</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">White light means power on</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">6</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Core Slot</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Connectable with multi-function controller core</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 20%;\">7</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Orientation Mark</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"text-align: center; height: 50px; width: 40%;\">Ensure proper installation alignment</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 120px; width: 111.864%;\">\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 40px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 13.6939%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 16.6547%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Model</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">Input Voltage</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">Current</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">Output Channel</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 13.1387%; padding: 10px !important;\">Weight</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"backgro